<!-- Hardened runtime with no exceptions, for the app and its two helpers (pool-core, pool-runner), which the
     bundler signs with the same identity. Not App Sandboxed: the app starts the agent, and the agent confines
     each job runner with its own deny-by-default sandbox profile (no network, no user files). No JIT, no
     unsigned libraries, no debugger attachment. -->
